    {
      "id": "t20_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Subpatches: your own reusable nodes\n\nA `meta/subpatch` is a box that hides a sub-graph behind custom input/output ports. Double-click the subpatch to descend into it; click the breadcrumb to come back.\n\nHere we built a \"ColoredRect(x, y, hue)\" subpatch and used it twice.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Subpatches: your own reusable nodes\n\nA `meta/subpatch` is a box that hides a sub-graph behind custom input/output ports. Double-click the subpatch to descend into it; click the breadcrumb to come back.\n\nHere we built a \"ColoredRect(x, y, hue)\" subpatch and used it twice.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
